    "abstract": "Parts figure for the auxiliary power unit air intake installation covering the flap, the actuator mounting group, the shroud and the compartment attachment hardware.",
    "sections": {
      "purpose": "This figure identifies the parts of the auxiliary power unit air intake installation, including the actuator mounting group and the shroud that carries the output bearing.",
      "figure_note": "The view is from inside the compartment looking outboard with the tail cone access door open. The shroud at item 10 carries the output bearing on post-modification aircraft and a plain bush on pre-modification aircraft; the two are not interchangeable and the mounting nut at item 30 changes with them. The barrel nut at item 30A is not procurable for a post-modification shroud. Item 60 shows the four-engine bracket, which is a different part and is called out on sheet 2 only."
    },
